","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_lifeagain_04_s_46","text":"I didn't think you'd tell me to run track and field right away!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lifeagain_04_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"rumani","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_lifeagain_04_s_47","text":"You won't be the one doing it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lifeagain_04_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"rumani","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_lifeagain_04_s_48","text":"This avatar here will.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lifeagain_04_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"rumani","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_lifeagain_04_s_49","text":"All you need to do is imagine yourself doing it in your mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lifeagain_04_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"rumani","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_lifeagain_04_s_50","text":"Since you're sitting in a wheelchair, you won't get muscle cramps or lose strength in your legs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lifeagain_04_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"nadia","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_lifeagain_04_s_51","text":"Still, this is all a bit sudden...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_lifeagain_04_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"rumani","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_lifeagain_04_s_52","text":"You're sounding weak already. I'm disappointed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"